 
  Welcome to Horizon OS 0.1  (live medium)
 
  Horizon OS is an Arch-based distribution with pacman and AUR support.
  This release ships the stock Arch kernel; selectable kernels (including the
  custom horizon-kernel) arrive in a later release.
 
  Installation guide : https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Installation_guide
                       or run:  Installation_guide
 
  Wi-Fi              : iwctl
  Mobile broadband   : mmcli
 
  Ethernet, WLAN and WWAN interfaces using DHCP should work automatically.
 
  Horizon tools       : `horizon --help`, `horizon-install` (TUI installer)
 
  Documentation      : https://github.com/JustAKid-hash/Horizon-OS
